Rem ===================================================================
Rem cave-travel.shoddy -- generated from adventure.yaml by gen.shoddy.
Rem Do not edit by hand: run  build.cmd gen  (./build.sh gen) instead.
Rem
Rem The travel table, flattened one row per (rule, verb) pair.
Rem Row 0 is a dummy so that Tkey 0 can mean 'no travel here'.
Rem Tkey(loc) is the first row for a location; scan forward until
Rem a row with Stop set. CondType: 0 none 1 pct 2 carry 3 with
Rem 4 not.  DestType: 0 goto 1 special 2 speak.
Rem ===================================================================

